{{also|Feminist}}
==English==

===Etymology===
First recorded in English 1894, from French {{term|féministe|lang=fr}} (1872). Ultimately from {{etyl|la|en}} {{term/t|la|fēminīnus}}, from {{term/t|la|fēmina||woman}}. See also {{term|feminine|lang=en}}, {{term|feminism|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈfɛmənɪst/}}, {{X-SAMPA|/"fEm@nIst/}}

